    <selectionEntry name="[E] - Rikkit´Tik, sabio del clan Eshin, especialista en venenos" id="5f35-ce27-a8f6-0e9f" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Héroes" id="4300-b6b6-1a36-d7d6" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="4865726f657323232344415441232323"/>
        <categoryLink name="Personajes" id="7be8-9c95-6a8e-f828" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="e839-bd6b-7e36-e758"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="447d-bbcd-2775-a92e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
        <cost name="pts de Asedio" typeId="7deb-c7e6-415b-8067" value="0"/>
      </costs>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Infantería" id="0c7c-b6c9-b696-e032" hidden="false" targetId="5b75-bd6b-d17a-6b7d" type="rule"/>
        <infoLink name="La fuerza del número" id="2ff9-0ffe-657a-b42d" hidden="false" targetId="0fc2-9bf9-b684-e980" type="rule"/>
        <infoLink name="Coraje mezquino" id="d82a-d1ff-46da-bbf9" hidden="false" targetId="960b-38ee-0189-d25c" type="rule"/>
